"        [\\ B<-I>I<Verz>\\ ]\\ [\\ B<-m>[B<->]I<Modul>\\ ]\\ [\\ B<-M>[B<->]I<'Modul…'>\\ ]\\ [\\ B<-f>\\ ]\n"
